{
  "name": "multi-place-visit-photo-record",
  "skill_id": "multi-place-visit-photo-record",
  "notes": [
    "Catalog lookups returned no results in this environment; node types used are the standard core types referenced by the skill's semantics (manual trigger, If, Set, HTTP Request, Agent).",
    "The skill's per-place loop (navigate → wait for background Job completed → get_camera_frame → save) is expressed as a single ordered pass over the place list; the loop body is represented once with the place list carried in $json.places.",
    "No trajectory events were provided, so every node and edge cites a SKILL.md line.",
    "File-system operations (mktemp -d, cp) and the present tool have no catalog node; they are delegated to an Agent with needs_user_input for the workspace/credential."
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Start visit request",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "slots": {},
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "12",
        "quote": "从用户请求取得有序地点列表"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Resolve places on semantic map",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "slots": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "",
        "json_body": {
          "places": "={{ $json.places }}"
        },
        "needs_user_input": [
          "url"
        ]
      },
      "tool": "search_ragflow_semantic_map",
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "12",
        "quote": "在同一模型步骤中分别查询各地点的 `search_ragflow_semantic_map`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "Keep unique matches and anchors",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "assignments": {
          "places": "={{ $json.places }}",
          "anchor_id": "={{ $json.anchor_id }}",
          "place_name": "={{ $json.place_name }}"
        },
        "include_other_fields": true
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "12",
        "quote": "一次保留全部地点的唯一匹配及 `anchor_id`、`place_name`，后续复用，不重复查询"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Places uniquely determined?",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.place_unresolved }}",
        "op": "eq",
        "right": true,
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "12",
        "quote": "地点不能唯一确定时先询问，不猜测目标"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "name": "Ask user to clarify place",
      "n8n_type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "slots": {
        "prompt": "地点无法唯一确定。请向用户询问并确认目标地点，不要猜测。已解析结果：{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "needs_user_input": [
          "credential_name"
        ]
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "12",
        "quote": "地点不能唯一确定时先询问，不猜测目标"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "name": "Navigate to place",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "slots": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "",
        "json_body": {
          "anchor_id": "={{ $json.anchor_id }}",
          "place_name": "={{ $json.place_name }}"
        },
        "needs_user_input": [
          "url"
        ]
      },
      "tool": "navigate",
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "13",
        "quote": "按顺序调用 `navigate`，沿用当前部署的 `anchor_id`、`place_name` 参数，不传 `scene_id`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "name": "Navigation running?",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.status }}",
        "op": "eq",
        "right": "running",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "13",
        "quote": "返回 `running` 后结束本轮，等待与该调用对应的后台 Job `completed` 通知"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "name": "Wait for background Job completed",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "slots": {
        "resume": "webhook"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "13",
        "quote": "等待与该调用对应的后台 Job `completed` 通知；不轮询、不重复提交"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "name": "Job completed successfully?",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.job_status }}",
        "op": "eq",
        "right": "completed",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "13",
        "quote": "后台失败或状态未知时，不启动下一站"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "name": "Report background failure and stop",
      "n8n_type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "slots": {
        "prompt": "后台导航 Job 失败或状态未知，请报告工具返回结果并结束，不启动下一站、不重试。结果：{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "needs_user_input": [
          "credential_name"
        ]
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "13",
        "quote": "后台失败或状态未知时，不启动下一站"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "name": "Get camera frame",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "slots": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "",
        "json_body": {
          "anchor_id": "={{ $json.anchor_id }}",
          "place_name": "={{ $json.place_name }}"
        },
        "needs_user_input": [
          "url"
        ]
      },
      "tool": "get_camera_frame",
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "14",
        "quote": "收到完成通知后调用 `get_camera_frame`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "name": "Keep frame_id, capture time, attachment ref",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "assignments": {
          "frame_id": "={{ $json.frame_id }}",
          "captured_at": "={{ $json.captured_at }}",
          "attachment_ref": "={{ $json.attachment_ref }}",
          "place_name": "={{ $json.place_name }}",
          "anchor_id": "={{ $json.anchor_id }}"
        },
        "include_other_fields": true
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "14",
        "quote": "使用该次结果中的附件引用保存图片，保留 `frame_id` 和原始采集时间"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "name": "Save photo into visit directory",
      "n8n_type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "slots": {
        "prompt": "在当前会话工作区执行一次 bash 调用：若 photos 目录不存在则创建；首次保存时用 mktemp -d photos/visit-XXXXXX 创建本次目录；从附件引用 sha256:HASH 提取完整 HASH，HH 为其前两位，源路径为 ../attachments/v1/objects/HH/HASH；按序号命名复制为 1.jpg、2.jpg 等；打印成功后的目录和文件路径。只执行一次复制并使用命令退出结果，不执行 ls/find/stat/date 或哈希命令，不去重。frame_id={{ $json.frame_id }}，原始采集时间={{ $json.captured_at }}，附件引用={{ $json.attachment_ref }}。",
        "needs_user_input": [
          "credential_name"
        ]
      },
      "tool": "bash",
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "22",
        "quote": "首次保存时，在同一次 `bash` 调用内创建 `photos`、用 `mktemp -d photos/visit-XXXXXX` 创建本次目录、复制图片并打印成功后的目录和文件路径"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "name": "Save succeeded?",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.save_ok }}",
        "op": "eq",
        "right": true,
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "15",
        "quote": "保存失败则报告工具结果并结束，不搜索、不修复重试"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "name": "Report save failure and stop",
      "n8n_type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "slots": {
        "prompt": "图片保存失败，请报告工具返回结果并结束，不搜索、不修复重试。结果：{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "needs_user_input": [
          "credential_name"
        ]
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "15",
        "quote": "保存失败则报告工具结果并结束，不搜索、不修复重试"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "name": "Append station record",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "assignments": {
          "order": "={{ $json.order }}",
          "place_name": "={{ $json.place_name }}",
          "nav_result": "后台报告完成",
          "frame_id": "={{ $json.frame_id }}",
          "captured_at": "={{ $json.captured_at }}",
          "photo_path": "={{ $json.photo_path }}"
        },
        "include_other_fields": true
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "15",
        "quote": "保存结果返回后，在会话中追加本站记录，并直接发起下一站导航"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "name": "More places remaining?",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.remaining_places }}",
        "op": "gt",
        "right": 0,
        "type": "number"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "15",
        "quote": "在会话中追加本站记录，并直接发起下一站导航"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "name": "Write visit-record.md",
      "n8n_type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "slots": {
        "prompt": "最后一站保存完成后，在本次照片目录中写 visit-record.md：只填一张表，列为 顺序 | 地点 | 导航结果 | frame_id | 原始采集时间 | 照片引用；导航结果写“后台报告完成”，照片写实际保存路径，图片链接使用 1.jpg 等相对路径；末尾保留一句“本记录未核验现场位置和照片当前性。”，不附加校验报告、证据讨论或改进建议。记录数据：{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "needs_user_input": [
          "credential_name"
        ]
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "27",
        "quote": "报告保存为本次照片目录中的 `visit-record.md`，图片链接使用 `1.jpg` 等相对路径"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "name": "Present report",
      "n8n_type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "slots": {
        "prompt": "调用 present 展示 visit-record.md 报告，然后用一两句中文说明后台完成数量及记录路径。报告内容：{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "needs_user_input": [
          "credential_name"
        ]
      },
      "tool": "present",
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "16",
        "quote": "调用 `present` 展示报告，最后用一两句中文说明后台完成数量及记录路径"
      }
    }
  ],
